msgid "延后工作队列"
msgstr "Deferred workqueues"

msgid ""
"``include/reliefnt/workqueue.h`` 提供 ReliefNT 自有内核内部接口，参考 Linux "
"工作项的投递、合并和取消机制，不是 Linux 内部 ``work_struct`` 的二进制或 源码兼容层，也不改变 Linux/POSIX 用户态 "
"ABI。"
msgstr ""
"``include/reliefnt/workqueue.h`` provides ReliefNT's own internal kernel "
"interface, drawing on Linux work-item submission, coalescing, and "
"cancellation mechanisms. It is not a binary or source compatibility layer "
"for Linux's internal ``work_struct`` and does not change the Linux/POSIX "
"userspace ABI."

msgid "执行与边界"
msgstr "Execution and boundaries"

msgid ""
"队列使用单独的短自旋锁保护链表和状态；投递可来自 IRQ 或任务上下文， 不分配内存、不执行回调。即时工作和按单调 tick 延时的工作共享按截止时间 "
"排列的队列，同一时刻的顺序保持 FIFO。重复投递合并；正在运行的工作可以 再投递一代，但同一工作不会并发执行。"
msgstr ""
"The queue uses a separate short-held spinlock to protect its lists and "
"state; submission can come from IRQ or task context and neither allocates "
"memory nor executes callbacks. Immediate work and work delayed by monotonic "
"ticks share a deadline-ordered queue, with FIFO order for equal times. "
"Repeated submissions are coalesced; running work can submit one further "
"generation, but the same work item never executes concurrently."

msgid ""
"定时器只在截止时间到达时请求调度，不在 IRQ 中执行工作。调度和空闲路径 从每 CPU 的服务栈派发独立的 ``kworker/N:0`` "
"内核线程，由线程保留的栈 消费工作。默认每批最多四个回调，在回调之间检查 2 ms 预算，处理前后检查 输入。worker "
"无工作时睡眠；延时截止或新投递唤醒它，没有就绪线程时不切换 派发栈。"
msgstr ""
"The timer requests scheduling only when a deadline is reached and does not "
"execute work in IRQ context. Scheduling and idle paths dispatch independent "
"``kworker/N:0`` kernel threads from per-CPU service stacks; the threads "
"consume work on their preserved stacks. By default, each batch runs at most "
"four callbacks, checking the 2 ms budget between callbacks and checking "
"input before and after processing. A worker sleeps when it has no work; "
"delayed-work expiry or a new submission wakes it. The dispatch stack is not "
"switched when no thread is ready."

msgid ""
"批次预算不会强制中断持有执行事务的回调。回调释放执行事务并允许中断后， 其独立栈可以在安全的定时器返回处被抢占；仍不提供硬实时延迟上限。 "
"线程执行与临界区约束见 :doc:`kthread`。"
msgstr ""
"The batch budget does not forcibly interrupt a callback holding an execution"
" transaction. Once the callback releases the execution transaction and "
"enables interrupts, its independent stack can be preempted at a safe timer "
"return; there is still no hard real-time latency bound. See :doc:`kthread` "
"for thread execution and critical-section constraints."

msgid ""
"执行者持有深度一的执行事务，队列锁不跨回调。回调只操作自己保留的内核 对象，不借用触发任务的用户缓冲区、描述符或重试状态。等待驱动的回调继续 使用原来的"
" manager admission、模块 pin 和执行事务 suspend/resume 协议； "
"调用者不得持有回调需要的锁。同一执行上下文等待自身回调返回会得到 ``EDEADLK``。同 CPU 的其他任务可通过调度进展等待该回调退出， 不会仅因"
" CPU 相同而被误判为自等待。"
msgstr ""
"The executor holds a depth-one execution transaction, and the queue lock is "
"not held across callbacks. Callbacks operate only on kernel objects they "
"retain, without borrowing the triggering task's user buffers, descriptors, "
"or retry state. Callbacks waiting for drivers continue to use the existing "
"manager admission, module pin, and execution-transaction suspend/resume "
"protocol; callers must not hold locks needed by the callback. Waiting for "
"one's own callback to return in the same execution context yields "
"``EDEADLK``. Other tasks on the same CPU can wait for that callback to exit "
"through scheduling progress; sharing a CPU alone is not mistaken for self-"
"wait."

msgid "取消、排空与模块"
msgstr "Cancellation, draining, and modules"

msgid ""
"``kernel_work_cancel_sync`` 关闭本次取消期间的投递，移除待执行代并等待当前 "
"回调退出。永久释放上下文之前，调用者还必须停止外部生产者；取消返回后 新的独立投递仍可发生。``kernel_work_flush`` "
"等待调用时观察到的那一代， 显式提前执行仍在延时队列中的工作，后来再次投递的代不在等待范围内。 "
"两者只能在无回调依赖锁的任务上下文调用，必要时暂时释放深度一执行事务。"
msgstr ""
"``kernel_work_cancel_sync`` blocks submission for the duration of the "
"cancellation, removes the pending generation, and waits for the current "
"callback to exit. Before permanently releasing the context, callers must "
"also stop external producers; a new independent submission can still occur "
"after cancellation returns. ``kernel_work_flush`` waits for the generation "
"observed at the time of the call, explicitly running work still in the "
"delayed queue early; later resubmitted generations are outside the wait. "
"Both may be called only from task context without locks on which callbacks "
"depend, temporarily releasing a depth-one execution transaction if "
"necessary."

msgid ""
"静态工作用 ``KERNEL_WORK_INIT`` 初始化，存储和上下文必须保持有效。 模块使用 ``kernel_work_create`` "
"分配由核心持有的工作，并登记模块清理义务。 每个获准投递的代持有执行 pin，取消或回调返回时才释放；模块进入 GOING 后 "
"拒绝新投递。卸载先禁用/取消，再排空执行引用，最后才释放工作存储和模块 代码。显式销毁模块工作只禁用它，存储留到模块清理账本最终释放。"
msgstr ""
"Static work is initialized with ``KERNEL_WORK_INIT``; its storage and "
"context must remain valid. Modules use ``kernel_work_create`` to allocate "
"core-owned work and register a module cleanup obligation. Each admitted "
"generation holds an execution pin until cancellation or callback return; new"
" submissions are rejected once the module enters GOING. Unloading first "
"disables/cancels work, then drains execution references, and only then "
"releases work storage and module code. Explicitly destroying module work "
"only disables it; storage remains until final release by the module cleanup "
"ledger."

msgid "系统维护接入"
msgstr "System maintenance integration"

msgid "普通系统调用入口不再同步调用下列维护函数："
msgstr ""
"Ordinary syscall entry no longer calls the following maintenance functions "
"synchronously:"

msgid "USB 端口服务由 host 请求触发；manager 忙或仍有待办时延后一 tick 重试。"
msgstr ""
"USB port service is triggered by host requests; if the manager is busy or "
"work remains pending, it retries one tick later."

msgid "失败的 detached mount finish 由保留该 mount/provider 的 FIFO 触发重试。"
msgstr ""
"Failed detached mount finish operations are retried by a FIFO that retains "
"the mount/provider."

msgid ""
"图形回收在 provider 存在期间按 tick 处理 fence 和原有小批次；COMING 时保留轮询，实际回调仍只接纳 LIVE "
"owner，detach 后停止。"
msgstr ""
"Graphics reclamation processes fences and the existing small batches on each"
" tick while a provider exists; polling continues during COMING, but actual "
"callbacks still admit only a LIVE owner, and stop after detach."

msgid "音频 IRQ tick 保持原有有界完成处理，将任务上下文工作投递到队列。"
msgstr ""
"Audio IRQ ticks retain the existing bounded completion handling and submit "
"task-context work to the queue."

msgid ""
"网络保留每 tick 的协议维护心跳，继续使用原来的 pending 检查、包预算和 tick gate，保障 poll-only NIC、TCP "
"重传和 IPv6 邻居发现不依赖普通 syscall。"
msgstr ""
"Networking retains its per-tick protocol maintenance heartbeat and the "
"existing pending checks, packet budget, and tick gate, ensuring that poll-"
"only NICs, TCP retransmission, and IPv6 neighbor discovery do not depend on "
"ordinary syscalls."

msgid ""
"这些永久派发器不对可选 provider 持有队列期间的永久引用；实际进入 provider 时重新取得现有服务与代码 "
"pin。用户返回前的输入、信号和重新调度检查保留。"
msgstr ""
"These permanent dispatchers do not hold a permanent reference to an optional"
" provider while queued; they reacquire the existing service and code pins "
"when actually entering the provider. Input, signal, and rescheduling checks "
"before returning to userspace remain in place."

msgid "验证"
msgstr "Validation"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_workqueue.py`` 检查实际队列、执行锁、合并、延时、运行中重投递、 取消等待及模块 pin。用户返回夹具检查普通 "
"syscall 不再运行维护，并验证 纯 CPU 和空闲入口的服务栈。外部测试模块 "
"``tools/tests/kmodules/workqueue_probe/`` 在实际模块加载后从 IRQ 投递工作， "
"开放短暂的执行事务释放窗口，供来宾检查运行中卸载及代码引用排空。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_workqueue.py`` checks the actual queue, execution lock, "
"coalescing, delays, resubmission while running, cancellation waits, and "
"module pins. The user-return fixture checks that ordinary syscalls no longer"
" run maintenance and validates service stacks for CPU-only and idle entry "
"paths. The external test module ``tools/tests/kmodules/workqueue_probe/`` "
"submits work from IRQ context after actual module loading and opens a brief "
"execution-transaction release window so the guest can check unloading during"
" execution and draining of code references."
